<div class="jfs-kbl-wrap">
<style>
    #jfs-keybind-locks-config .jfs-kbl-intro { margin: 0 0 8px; opacity: 0.8; font-size: 0.9em; }
    #jfs-keybind-locks-config fieldset { border: 1px solid var(--color-border-light-tertiary, #666); border-radius: 6px; margin: 0 0 10px; padding: 6px 10px 10px; }
    #jfs-keybind-locks-config legend { font-weight: 700; padding: 0 6px; }
    #jfs-keybind-locks-config .jfs-kbl-hint { font-size: 0.85em; opacity: 0.75; margin: 0 0 6px; }
    #jfs-keybind-locks-config .jfs-kbl-list { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 3px; }
    #jfs-keybind-locks-config .jfs-kbl-row { display: flex; gap: 8px; align-items: center; padding: 3px 6px; border: 1px solid var(--color-border-light-tertiary, #555); border-radius: 4px; }
    #jfs-keybind-locks-config .jfs-kbl-actionlabel { flex: 1 1 auto; min-width: 0; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; white-space: nowrap; }
    #jfs-keybind-locks-config .jfs-kbl-ns { opacity: 0.65; font-size: 0.85em; }
    #jfs-keybind-locks-config .jfs-kbl-summary { flex: 0 0 auto; font-family: monospace; font-size: 0.85em; padding: 1px 8px; border-radius: 10px; white-space: nowrap; }
    #jfs-keybind-locks-config .jfs-kbl-summary.is-clear { background: rgba(200,90,90,0.22); }
    #jfs-keybind-locks-config .jfs-kbl-summary.is-set { background: rgba(90,140,255,0.22); }
    #jfs-keybind-locks-config .jfs-kbl-remove { flex: 0 0 auto; }
    #jfs-keybind-locks-config .jfs-kbl-empty { font-size: 0.85em; opacity: 0.6; margin: 4px 0; }
    #jfs-keybind-locks-config .jfs-kbl-add { margin-top: 6px; }
    #jfs-keybind-locks-config footer { display: flex; justify-content: flex-end; margin-top: 6px; }
</style>

<p class="jfs-kbl-intro">
    Force keybindings to stay <strong>cleared</strong> (unbound) or <strong>set</strong> to a specific key on every load.
    This re-applies on load, so bindings that keep reverting will stay how you set them here.
</p>

{{#if isGM}}
<fieldset>
    <legend><i class="fas fa-users"></i> Baseline &mdash; applies to everyone</legend>
    <p class="jfs-kbl-hint">Pushed to all connected players and re-applied on each client's load. A player's personal lock for the same action overrides this.</p>
    <div class="jfs-kbl-list" data-scope="baseline"></div>
    <button type="button" class="jfs-kbl-add" data-scope="baseline"><i class="fas fa-plus"></i> Add baseline lock</button>
</fieldset>
{{/if}}

<fieldset>
    <legend><i class="fas fa-user"></i> Personal &mdash; only you</legend>
    <p class="jfs-kbl-hint">Applies only to you. Overrides the baseline for the same action.</p>
    <div class="jfs-kbl-list" data-scope="personal"></div>
    <button type="button" class="jfs-kbl-add" data-scope="personal"><i class="fas fa-plus"></i> Add personal lock</button>
</fieldset>

<footer>
    <button type="submit"><i class="fas fa-save"></i> Save &amp; Apply</button>
</footer>
</div>
